{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 62628, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 46601, "uid": 63226, "type": 4, "title": "点火词条的选择分享&amp;转载（1217更新）", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1607075385, "updated_at": 1631090517, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1621690933, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 75, "status": 1, "summary": "*友情提示非专业攻略，仅仅代表我的看法可能有错误，希望指证关于红爆红敏红攻的计算公式，可以参考大佬http://dc.gamekee.com/52136.html12.22新增红攻爆敏白攻的固伤刀伤害", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608606419614_87483968.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1607076221364_96056327.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1607076221342_12808517.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 29, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 47966, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 1, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 62628, "content": "<div><p class=\"p1\">* 友情提示非专业攻略，仅仅代表我的看法可能有错误，希望指证</p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\">关于红爆红敏红攻的计算公式，可以参考大佬<span></span></p><p>http://dc.gamekee.com/52136.html</p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">12.22 新增红攻爆敏白攻的固伤刀伤害实测</span></p><p>基本符合上述公式，基本认知：</p><p>1、所有场合红攻收益&gt;红暴<span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">&gt;红敏，仅在弱点FT场合红敏&gt;</span></span>白攻<span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">&gt;红暴</span></span></p><p><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">2、红攻红爆+白攻，也是可以用的石头（不考虑百分比刀，百分比刀白攻是上位）</span></span></p><p><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">3、如果raid不能完成无FT斩车，需要FT的话，红攻红敏红敏（或红敏双红攻）整体输出会更高更平稳。</span></span></p><p><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">4、</span></span>推测场景的含义：A组是75%暴击率时候估算伤害期望，非弱点，基本能代表PVP时候的期望；B组带弱点，代表活动本期望；C组在B组基础上，默认还有50%的伤害是FT造成，综合了弱点普攻的成分，代表需要FT的raid或者集中FT的wb；D/E组代表PVP没暴击辅助时候，能打出的伤害期望。</p><p><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">5、数值反应趋势，是实战肉眼测取得的，可能存在+ -1000的误差，如果有细微矛盾见谅，但是弱点暴击的情况是重点测试量级不会有误。</span></span></p><p><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">6、对于平民，有红攻红爆，剩下搭任意进攻向的石头就已经是好石头了，可以放心给活动对象用。</span></span></p><p><br></p><p><span></span></p><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608606419614_87483968.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1608606419614_87483968.png\"></div><br><p></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p></p><p class=\"p2\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"p1\">【词条】<br></p>\n<p class=\"p1\">红攻：按照攻击比例提升伤害，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">适用所有场合</span>。</p><p class=\"p1\">红攻在PVP这种对面高防的场合比较有用，不论出现在主词条还是副词条里，在PVP场合中建议搭配红防使用，第三个位置可以继续红攻或者HP、红防。</p><p class=\"p1\">同时在活动本红攻也是优先选择对象。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">总结：爸爸。泛用性普遍，一般认为优于红敏红暴。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\">红防：额外按照一定比例减伤，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">主要适用PVP</span>。</p><p class=\"p1\">如果2个红防或者红防+HP，那么耐打程度会上升一个档次，原本可能被一个SS秒，装备后可能会红血，多一轮出手机会。JJC大家都带U6连刀的情况下，不带红防又血少的攻击、干扰选手，第二轮出手机会堪忧。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">总结：大哥。PVP人手必备，不限主次。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\">红暴：暴击场额外增伤，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">主要适用wb，raid。</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\"><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">奶请不要选择红暴，对奶量无用，请选择白暴。</span></span></span></p><p class=\"p1\">暴击情况下红爆(每百点+30%)&gt;红敏(每百点+20%)&gt;红攻（每百点+15%），但无暴击情况包括FT时收益会损失。</p><p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">总结：有暴击拐时的王者。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\">红敏：增加弱点伤害，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 240);\">主要适用raid，次选wb，优势是持续性伤害</span>。</p><p class=\"p1\">见与红暴的比较，活动本里我觉得和红暴的选择是都可以，raid里可能红敏更好点（如果要靠FT输出话）</p><p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">总结：活动本泛用增伤，二哥。</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"p1\">其他白字：直接加在面板，点满加固定数值。</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">HP：白字里面的南波湾，甚至不输红攻防的存在，除非你要打全攻爆，否则HP在任何地方出现都不算减分。</p><p class=\"p1\"><span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">总结：PVP爸爸的爸爸。</span></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"p1\">白防：鉴于有减防，甚至0防的存在，白防堆高着实意义不大，另外有心上白防，还可以靠装备、魂卡来调整，实在不值得用点火（这种限定死的方式）来增强，所以还是优先考虑红防。</p><p class=\"p1\"><span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">总结：出这个词条就相当于天生缺了一个词条：），他已经不是弟弟的问题，他是那种.....（残疾的弟弟）</span></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"p1\">白攻：上面已经说了，PVP里尽量不要白攻，活动本可以选择。PVP里白攻堆高，HP又少，过于容易被集火，不如低调点换红攻+HP，低调隐藏实力偷偷摸伤害，让其他角色去吸引火力，除非你想打暴击一波流；另外白攻极其容易打乱最高攻，理论上也只有一二攻才能附这个，辅助尽量避免加白攻。</p><p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">总结：调整属性时需要，百分比刀的爸爸。</span></p><p class=\"p1\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"p1\">白暴：算是白字里面唯3有用的，主要是用来堆暴击发挥技能效果，而不在乎伤害，比如奶等角色。它和红爆的选择是需要综合辅助考虑的。白暴堆高，意味着HP和防御的薄弱，你要顾及这2者，攻击就很贫乏，所以白暴只适合奶或辅助。</p><p class=\"p1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">总结：仅仅是奶爸的爸爸。</span></p><br></div><div><br></div><div>具体的取舍，参考下面3个图，出自韩服，大体适用国际服。图一主要快速甄别级别，图二是对石头适用场合较为准确的总结，图三看看备注吧（不确保正确性）。</div><div>【如果顶部的公式正确，红暴和红敏增强后，下方所有表格里涉及红爆和红敏的三红石头评分显著偏低】</div><div><span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1607152410636_84173691.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1607152410636_84173691.jpg\"></div></span><br></div><div><br><span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1607076221342_12808517.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1607076221342_12808517.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1607076221364_96056327.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1607076221364_96056327.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">【材料】</div><div class=\"div-img\">child不足情况下，我选择泛用性来使用材料，优先红攻（容易出货，副属性攻向就给活动，防向就给PVP，除了出白敏爆基本都能用），然后是红防（赌一赌极品双红攻，另外红防+HP，双HP，红攻+任意 都是不错的PVP石头），再就是红敏和红爆<span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">（赌白攻白攻、白攻红攻，双红攻给不同类型活动刀，但是洗出防敏暴基本就100%狗粮）</span></span>。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(84, 141, 212); background-color: rgb(219, 238, 243);\">祝大家都能洗到自己心仪的石头~~~</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com